Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL OFFLINE] iommu: apple-dart: A9 S5L8960X ordered TTBR/TLB and fail-closed faults
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Reference: OrchardLinux/orchard iommu apple-dart 0004 and 0006, source-adapted.
Upstream contributors: Berkay Kösebay and Henrik Klee; see original Orchard patch history.
No copyright assignment or representation of upstream acceptance is claimed.
Requires prior N71 patch 0014: base alignment validation and independent TCR lock.
This patch is only a separate Linux ARM64 compilation experiment. The original
all-stream reset, physical S8000 PCIe requester/DART1 SID and NAND/baseband
isolation are UNPROVEN; it must NOT be automatically loaded on a phone.
Owner-private firmware, ADT and device-specific calibration are not included.
